    "text": {
     "en": "About 71 percent of the Earth is water, mostly in five oceans: Pacific, Atlantic, Indian, Southern and Arctic. Land is divided into seven continents.\nOceans give us fish, salt, oxygen, rain and trade routes. But they can bring cyclones, tsunamis and rising seas.\nIslands are pieces of land surrounded by water. India has Andaman and Nicobar and Lakshadweep islands."
    }
